        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Hallelujah he hallelujah Amen,",
            "Kalvari jeihang jaujian pan khou rui;",
            "Kapmei leh rianramei ram jingmei khou,",
            "Neilamei tingkau ram rui gan guang.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Neilamei tuai dat mak (hallelujah-2),",
            "Thuanmei su kandiu he Laujiu Nahta;",
            "Kajaujian rui rianramei timan.",
            "",
            "2. He bumang thanmei leh neilamei kei o,",
            "Hallelujah tuna rianra ram khou;",
            "Neilana lani e rianra nun rui,",
            "Nangban 5#^ kaniu tingkauh suni.",
            "",
            "3. Tingsang rianramei ramguai manpui kan khou,",
            "Neila gaimei Sharon mun gaimei 5#^;",
            "Tingsanga puang puni tuai dat maknga,",
            "Nangta ning liange nduang lou o.",
            "",
            "4. Kandih mei rui thai diu poubaumei ramta,",
            "Tingkau bumang thanmei nun rui neila diu;",
            "Kalvari Laujiu Nah jianloumei pu,",
            "Nangta ninga suanni tingsangjang."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
